  "bodyHash": "48da44113920f041",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\">繩索橋現在支援 1.20.1！</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">加入我的 Discord，認識開發者並查看 Cazsius 的其他模组！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/JZzD4EQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/JZzD4EQ</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果您喜歡我的模组，請考慮在右上角進行捐贈，每一枚硬幣都能幫助我購買飲料以繼續工作！&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:14px\">如果您發現任何錯誤或崩潰，請在此<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://github.com/MinecraftModDevelopmentMods/Rope-Bridge/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">回報</a>！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#396\">加入我朋友們經營的 MMD Discord，認識各種模組合作者和有趣的人！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#396\"><a style=\"color:#396\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fdiscord.mcmoddev.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.mcmoddev.com</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left\">來看看 Amaxter 為 1.10.2 版本製作的展示影片！</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hcuuCOLVsbc?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多評價於下方 Spoiler 區塊：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LrvfaaNiUGg?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6QG4OIipFn0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VYcNTNBfFak?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Rope-Bridge 是一款能建造（如您所想）繩索橋，並且現在還能建造繩索梯的模组！特色：</span></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:left\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">橋樑建造槍，由三個可獨立組裝的零件構成</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">梯子建造槍，由三個可獨立組裝的零件構成</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">簡單的指哪打哪系統</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">建造動畫</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">自訂橋樑四分之一板</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">障礙方塊偵測</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完全相容伺服器端</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新的線製作配方（提示：羊毛）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">精美的模型，尤其在 1.10.2 及以上版本。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">紋理取自已載入的資源包</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">效能提升</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增設定檔，內含多個可調整數值</span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/czechmate777/BridgeBuilder#crafting\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\"></a>製作</span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">要製作抓鉤槍，必須先分別製作三個子零件：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">請注意：1.12 以上版本現在需要「繩索」而非「線」。&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>請注意：梯子槍配方即將推出。將使用桶身與握把，但槍頭部分不同。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鉤子：5 個鐵錠</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/czechmate777/BridgeBuilder/blob/master/images/hook.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/czechmate777/BridgeBuilder/raw/master/images/hook.png\" alt=\"Hook\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">桶身：6 個鐵錠、3 條線</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/czechmate777/BridgeBuilder/blob/master/images/barrel.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/czechmate777/BridgeBuilder/raw/master/images/barrel.png\" alt=\"Barrel\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">握把：1 個打火石、1 份火藥、2 個鐵錠、1 條線、2 個木板</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/czechmate777/BridgeBuilder/blob/master/images/handle.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/czechmate777/BridgeBuilder/raw/master/images/handle.png\" alt=\"Stock\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">現在可以將這三個零件組合成槍身：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/czechmate777/BridgeBuilder/blob/master/images/crafting.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/czechmate777/BridgeBuilder/raw/master/images/crafting.png\" alt=\"Crafting\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">繩索配方：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">S = 線</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">V = 藤蔓</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">SV</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">VS</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">SV</span></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/czechmate777/BridgeBuilder#building\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a rel=\"nofollow\"></a>建造</span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">要建造橋樑，請像使用普通弓一樣射擊抓鉤槍。當瞄準抓鉤槍（右鍵點擊）時，玩家視角會拉近，並沿著基本方位（東、南、西、北）對齊。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/czechmate777/BridgeBuilder/blob/master/images/zoom.gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/czechmate777/BridgeBuilder/raw/master/images/zoom.gif\" alt=\"Zoom\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鬆開滑鼠後，若條件允許即可開始建造橋樑。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/czechmate777/BridgeBuilder/blob/master/images/release.gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/czechmate777/BridgeBuilder/raw/master/images/release.gif\" alt=\"Release\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在以下情況下無法建造橋樑：</span></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:left\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">路徑上有障礙物（會顯示煙霧粒子標記）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">橋樑坡度太陡</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">玩家背包中缺少所需材料</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>注意：</strong>這些限制可在設定檔中關閉。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果出現問題，聊天欄會顯示提示訊息說明問題所在及解決方法。若一切正常，橋樑將使用背包中的階梯板與線進行建造。橋樑的材質取決於背包中第一個找到的階梯板種類。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/czechmate777/BridgeBuilder/blob/master/images/build.gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/czechmate777/BridgeBuilder/raw/master/images/build.gif\" alt=\"Build\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您也可以透過指令在兩個座標之間建造橋樑：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>/ropebridge x1 y1 z1 x2 y2 z2 [wood_id]</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">例如：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>/ropebridge 0 60 0 20 64 0 5 </strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">將從 (0, 60, 0) 建造至 (20, 64, 0) 的深色橡木橋。<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若未填寫 wood_id，則會使用預設材質橡木進行建造。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>請注意，此指令目前僅適用於 1.8 及以下版本。</em></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">木質階梯板類型列表如下：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">橡木階梯板 - 0</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">雲杉木階梯板 - 1</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">白樺木階梯板 - 2</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">叢林木階梯板 - 3</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">金合歡木階梯板 - 4</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">深色橡木階梯板 - 5</span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要一次拆除整座橋樑，只需按住蹲下鍵並用抓鉤槍破壞任一橋樑區塊即可！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">希望您喜歡這個模组，也歡迎隨時提供改進建議。如果您希望將本模组用於影片中，只需標示來源，並透過 CurseForge 私人訊息告知我，或加入我的 Discord <a href=\"https://discord.gg/NRCQA6u\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
